version 1
// The explicit `transposition 8vb` states the sounding octave a bass carries — the
// same knob `instrument bass` sets as a default. With plain `clef bass` + `tuning
// bass`, a bare `c` (written C3) frets on the tab exactly as `instrument bass` does
// (A string, 3rd fret) and the notation shows the written pitch.
title "explicit transposition"
time 4/4
key c major
part bs { clef bass tuning bass transposition 8vb }
section A { bs { c1 | } }
form main { A }
score main { staff bs tab bs }
